<title>USA: CSX says on track for record year.</title>
<headline>CSX says on track for record year.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSX Corp said Thursday it is on track for a record year despite persistent rate pressure in the container shipping market.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect the rate pressure to persist for some time to come, but we think the worst is behind us,&quot; CSX Chairman John Snow told analysts in a meeting.</p>
<p>He said the rate environment will likely improve in the third and fourth quarters, and the company's Sea-Land unit will still have a record year.</p>
</text>
